{
 "duration": 23.993,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Last year, Leo got hiking boots as a gift.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.012
  },
  {
   "text": "They never left the box.",
   "start": 3.462,
   "end": 4.811
  },
  {
   "text": "He didn't know which trail to pick, what to pack, or how long it would take.",
   "start": 5.261,
   "end": 9.092
  },
  {
   "text": "This year, his sister gave him the plan to go with them:",
   "start": 9.542,
   "end": 12.582
  },
  {
   "text": "a beginner's guide to choose an easy first trail, a packing checklist, and a trip planner to fill in.",
   "start": 13.032,
   "end": 18.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Two weeks later, the boots were muddy.",
   "start": 19.15,
   "end": 20.986
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this if you're buying a hiker a gift.",
   "start": 21.436,
   "end": 23.793
  }
 ],
